{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415803","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415803","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1041580301:1":{"text":"哇！你这个造型太适合“鬼影密室”了！","source_cn":"哇！你这个造型太适合“鬼影密室”了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA913D4FBE4762C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041580302:1":{"text":"我一定要把你介绍给老板娘，让她在下次冬日祭典的时候邀请你去白熊温泉旅店扮鬼！","source_cn":"我一定要把你介绍给老板娘，让她在下次冬日祭典的时候邀请...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x72DEF7C4FD4428A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041580303:1":{"text":"冬日祭典？我好像在哪听说过这个名字……","source_cn":"冬日祭典？我好像在哪听说过这个名字……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0035351AEE94594C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041580304:1":{"text":"……啊，想起来了。你说的是白山公国的冬日祭典吧？","source_cn":"……啊，想起来了。你说的是白山公国的冬日祭典吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DC1EB3E550EC4CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041580305:1":{"text":"是啊！就在白山公国的雪松镇上。薄暮丛林可没有这么有趣的节日。","source_cn":"是啊！就在白山公国的雪松镇上。薄暮丛林可没有这么有趣的节日。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18FE6238F963883E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041580306:1":{"text":"这样说来，仔细一看……你生前是耀光人？","source_cn":"这样说来，仔细一看……你生前是耀光人？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F6CA02C32BF3F85","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041580307:1":{"text":"对，我是耀光人，不过现在应该算是耀光的鬼了。","source_cn":"对，我是耀光人，不过现在应该算是耀光的鬼了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1F65956AF61324C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041580308:1":{"text":"可惜我的家乡地处边境，一直动荡不安，我没有太多机会远行，所以不曾去过白山公国。","source_cn":"可惜我的家乡地处边境，一直动荡不安，我没有太多机会远行...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08CB974374FE7349","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041580309:1":{"text":"那你真的应该去看看！我觉得那里应该是耀光帝国对亡灵最友好的地方——呃，我的意思不是说其他耀光人都敌视亡灵。","source_cn":"那你真的应该去看看！我觉得那里应该是耀光帝国对亡灵最友...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF188316FD39B3DA1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041580310:1":{"text":"哈哈，不用这么紧张，我明白你的意思。","source_cn":"哈哈，不用这么紧张，我明白你的意思。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE89CE840C63537C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041580311:1":{"text":"而且很多耀光人确实很敌视亡灵，这是事实。我和我的家人朋友以前都是其中一员。","source_cn":"而且很多耀光人确实很敌视亡灵，这是事实。我和我的家人朋...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC47B8B902D1ACEE8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041580312:1":{"text":"要不是亲自去了一趟班题斯，可能我们的想法永远都不会改变。","source_cn":"要不是亲自去了一趟班题斯，可能我们的想法永远都不会改变。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A2F36EB7A1BF7A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041580313:1":{"text":"你竟然还去过班题斯！","source_cn":"你竟然还去过班题斯！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEDD0FDB53A45AD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041580314:1":{"text":"是啊，我就是在那里被转化成亡灵的。","source_cn":"是啊，我就是在那里被转化成亡灵的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EFFD9FE91087365","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041580315:1":{"text":"转化？！这听起来可不太妙……","source_cn":"转化？！这听起来可不太妙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x75A8E9726E4DC5EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041580316:1":{"text":"是啊，无论是肉体死亡还是灵魂被撕裂的感受，都不太好。","source_cn":"是啊，无论是肉体死亡还是灵魂被撕裂的感受，都不太好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B79D2910DE3E160","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041580317:1":{"text":"好了，别说这些了，还是来聊些高兴的吧。","source_cn":"好了，别说这些了，还是来聊些高兴的吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FBA3900A317506A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041580318:1":{"text":"能多给我讲讲有关白山公国和冬日祭典的事吗？如果将来有机会，我想和家人挚友一起去那里看看。","source_cn":"能多给我讲讲有关白山公国和冬日祭典的事吗？如果将来有机...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF058F8EE2C48B427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:洛桑":{"text":"洛桑","source":"洛桑","status":"source"},"speaker:巴登":{"text":"巴登","source":"巴登","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":19,"localized_text_count":18,"speaker_count":2}}